*.pyc

# Nothing else is ignored, on purpose.
#
# Your identity.md, your laws and your handoff are the point. They are meant to
# be committed — versioned, diffable, restorable. An identity you cannot roll
# back is one bad edit away from gone.
#
# If yours is personal: copy this repo rather than forking it, and make your
# copy private. Do not add your own files here to hide them from a fork you did
# not need to make.
